###
# 1️⃣ Freemium user

POST {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
apikey: {{supabaseKey}}

{
  "email": "{{freemiumEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

